INSTALLATION
====================
Check the file INSTALL in this directory for installation directions.
	Summary:
		Extract the archive in any directory you want.
		Visit the directory in the browser
		Follow instructions
		
UPGRADE
====================
You can upgrade from v1.* by navigating to the /install directory _AFTER_ you have installed phpns version 2. There is a checkbox next to to the continue button. Click it, and follow the instructions.
		
SCRIPT USE
====================
After your script is installed, you can 'include' the news by the following line:
	<?php include("/path/to/shownews.php"); ?>
	
Customization can be added, such as $limit, $category, $template, $offset.
		
